        "title": "The Sum to Infinity Formula",
        "text": "When $|r| < 1$, the sum to infinity exists and is given by:\n$$S_\\infty = \\frac{a}{1 - r}$$\n\nThis formula works because as $n \\to \\infty$, $r^n \\to 0$ when $|r| < 1$.",
